stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> pending : kid registers (UC-006)
    pending --> rejected : parent rejects, username freed (200)
    pending --> approved : parent approves (UC-008)
    rejected --> rejected : reject again, 409 already rejected
    approved --> approved : reject, 409 already approved
    pending --> pending : kid or no session, 403 or 401
    approved --> [*]
    rejected --> [*]
